  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agreement-evaluation in Bosnia-Herzegovina. In order to investigate the reguirements indicated by the Ministry of Foreign Affaires and the legal and other consequences it is recommended that a consultant undertakes a fact finding mission upon which suggestions will be made for Sida to consider. The Sida contribution amounts to SEK 80 000.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Avtalsstudie - Bosnien-Hercegovina. Studien ska unders&#xf6;ka generellt vilka krav relevanta bosniska myndigheter st&#xe4;ller p&#xe5; avtalsing&#xe5;ende vad g&#xe4;ller projekt som ska implementeras i Bosnien-Hercegovina och specifikt vad detta kommer att inneb&#xe4;ra f&#xf6;r Sida. Studien ska resultera i rekommendationer. Sida st&#xf6;djer studien med SEK 80 000.</narrative>
  </description>
